sequenceDiagram
    participant S as authentik-server
    participant J as Juju Secrets
    participant W as authentik-worker
    participant O as authentik-ldap-outpost

    S->>J: create secret(secret-key, db-password)
    S->>W: authentik-cluster databag {secret_key_secret_id, db_host, ...}
    S->>J: grant secret access to worker app
    W->>J: fetch secret by id (secret-key, db-password)

    S->>J: create secret(api-token)
    S->>O: authentik-server-info databag {authentik_host, authentik_token_secret_id}
    S->>J: grant secret access to ldap-outpost app
    O->>J: fetch secret by id (api-token)
